#   ✓ googletest (1.14.0) - C++ testing framework
#   ✓ google_benchmark (1.8.3) - C++ microbenchmarking
#   ✓ re2 (2023-09-01) - Regular expression library
#   ✓ zlib (1.3.1) - Compression library
